  "estimatedMinutes": 1,
  "statement": "The first three terms of a geometric progression are \\(\\sqrt2,\\) \\(\\sqrt[3]2,\\) \\(\\sqrt[6]2.\\) Find the fourth term.",
  "answerChoices": [
